        690.44,
        208.25,
        690.44
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to state that with\neffect from afternoon of January 26, 1979 -\n\n(i) Shri Ram Kinkar assumed the office of the\n Minister of State in the Ministry of Works and\n Housing and Supply and Rehabilitation.\n\n(ii) Shri Janeshwar Mishra assumed the office of\n the Minister of State in the Ministry of Energy.\n\n(iii) Shri Jagbir Singh assumed the office of the\n Minister of State in the Ministry of Information\n and Broadcasting.\n\n(iv) Shri Narsingh assumed the office of\n the Minister of State in the Ministry of\n Petroleum, Chemicals and Fertilizers."
    },
